# Title: Exfiltration Over Alternative Protocol
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1048
# Tactic: exfiltration
# Severity: medium
# Author: Wahid Hendrawan
# Date: 2026-06-04
# References:
#   - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1048/

index=windows OR index=endpoint
sourcetype IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational", "WinEventLog:Security")
powershell OR cmd outbound 53/443 non-standard
| stats count, values(CommandLine) as cmd, values(User) as user by _time, host, Image, ParentImage
| where count > 0
| sort - _time
